  "notes": [
    "Official monthly final positions and scoring columns take precedence over auxiliary tabs and the current API. API tables remain unchanged for audit.",
    "January uses the historical 20% column C in Calories Janeiro/25. February–September use column D (15% where applied); October–December column D (20% where applied). Per-row adjusted values are preserved, without changing the current global bonus flags.",
    "Hustle, days and duration tabs supply positions only, so missing raw values and tiebreak measurements remain null. Calorie raw values come from the ORIGINAL GYMRATS block.",
    "All monthly participants remain visible, including Geovana in June as named in the source. The season includes only the 20 names explicitly followed by Pontos Corridos 2025.",
    "The annual August column is mislabeled Agosto 2026. Its sheet references and matching August 2025 monthly positions establish that it belongs to 2025.",
    "The source places Jorge (144) before Thamyres (135), William (138), and Jéssica (142); the system sorts by ascending total.",
    "The source assigns absence scores of 18 in August and 13 in December. On 2026-10-29 the admin requested last-place-plus-one uniformly: August uses 19 (last position 18), December uses 12 (last position 11). The source snapshot remains unchanged; system totals reflect this correction."
